      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Solar system installed by SolarMatic on 1st April which was done in a very timely manner and the cost was reasonable but we have contacted the company concerning some minor damage that was caused by their installation team and we are still waiting for this matter to be finalised, we just want a can of spray paint the colour of our carport to do the repair ourselves. Also if you deal with SolarMatic I would said to make sure that you get a copy emailed to you of the Smart meter paperwork when it send to your power supplier as we have contacted our power supplier  3 times since 17th April and they have stated that no paperwork been received by them from SolarMatic but we have been informed/confirmed by SolarMatic staff by phone that the paperwork has been send.  We are not sure of this company after sales service is very professional as a customer all we have got is a run around. We are still waiting for information on our Smart meter to have it installed",
